      "created_at": "2016-01-29T05:32:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've run games of SotM at local game stores a few times and gotten good response from people in-store, but recently I had an encounter with another player who absolutely insisted that The Sentinels should add four to the H value of any game in which they are used, since there are a total of four character cards with that deck. This had never occurred to me. I've always operated under the assumption that one deck = 1 H, but this guy loudly insisted otherwise.</p><p>I can't find my printed rulesets anyplace, so for the sake of my sanity: The Sentinels still have an H value of 1, right?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:18.977Z",
