      "created_at": "2016-01-29T14:04:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wow, that would be ridiculous if they counted as H=4 all by themselves. If they did, apart from the difficulty of the game in general going through the roof, it would break some stuff - for example, Plague Rat would never be able to flip (unless you just had the Sentinels and one other hero).</p>",
